          "value": "International network: 1 bag and 1 accessory in Economy and Premium Economy (total weight 12 kg); 2 bags and 1 accessory in First and Business (total weight 18 kg).",
          "status": "official",
          "source_url": "https://www.aircotedivoire.com/informations/bagages",
          "verified_at": "2026-09-04",
          "verified_by": "manual_official_source"
        },
